{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36190","headline":"自缙云赴郡溪流百里轻棹一发曾不崇朝叙事四韵寄献段郎中 · 方干","name":"自缙云赴郡溪流百里轻棹一发曾不崇朝叙事四韵寄献段郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"激箭溪湍势莫凭，飘然一叶若爲乘。\n仰瞻青壁开天罅，斗转寒湾避石棱。\n巢鸟夜惊离岛树，啼猿昼怯下岩藤。\n此中明日寻知己，恐似龙门不易登。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}